  "description": "The Teammachine SLR TWO is built around our lightweight Advanced Carbon frame, forming the core of a race bike designed to defy gravity and perform across all gradients, in a package that’s more accessible.\nRefined over more than a decade, this evolution of the Teammachine platform continues to push stiffness-to-weight efficiency while preserving the composed handling and road feel that define BMC road bikes.\nAs the introduction to our flagship climbing bike range, it carries the full suite of BMC design intelligence, including TCC Race compliance and the D-shape seatpost, and the unmistakable BMC ride feel that’s explosive when pushed, precise in the corners, and impressively smooth when the road turns rough.\nShimano 105 Di2 provides reliable electronic shifting and braking, paired with the RSM01 stem and alloy handlebars for clean cable routing and straightforward position tuning. PRD23 wheels round out a carbon race bike build that stays focused on consistency, control, and ride quality.",
